This distribution includes image-processing and prompt code adapted from the
company's refresh.stream application. It is released here under Apache-2.0.

Thanks to Black Forest Labs for releasing FLUX.2 [klein] 4B under Apache-2.0,
which makes this self-hosted image-reconstruction project possible. Model
weights are downloaded separately and retain their own license and notices.

Bundled historical examples have individual source credits and rights descriptions
in web/examples/sources.json and web/examples/README.md. They are not customer data.

The optional GPU container builds on vLLM and vLLM-Omni (Apache-2.0), Hugging Face
Diffusers (Apache-2.0), PyTorch (BSD-style) and their dependencies. Those separately
downloaded packages retain their own licenses. App runtime dependencies likewise
retain the licenses distributed in their installed packages. No model weights,
third-party browser scripts or face-detection model files are bundled in this repo.
